@unit UNIT IV · MISCELLANEOUS

@chapter 21 | Economy Miscellany

@intro
The miscellaneous section collects questions that fit no single topic: **education policy**, sociological ideas, the **Competition Commission**, committees and their subjects, **economists and their books**, **Gandhian trusteeship**, national **institutes**, **energy and infrastructure** facts, and **quality marks** (AGMARK, Ecomark, ISO, GI). It contains **{pyqs} PYQs and {ones} one-liners**.
@end

