@q 15:5-7

**Robert E. Park** gave the idea of the **marginal man** (a person between two cultures). **Amartya Sen** coined "**missing women**" (1990) for the women missing because of sex-selective neglect. **Marshall McLuhan's "global village"** rests on fast **transport and communication**. The UN declared **2023** the **International Year of Millets**, on India's proposal.

@section 21.2 | Institutions, People and Committees

@q 15:8-12

The **Competition Commission of India** was set up on **14 October 2003** under the **Competition Act, 2002** (replacing the MRTP Commission). **Ravneet Kaur** (2023) is its first woman chairperson. **GCMMF** (Amul) markets milk; **Kristalina Georgieva** has headed the **IMF** since 2019. **A.M. Khusro** chaired the 11th Finance Commission, not the UPSC.

