@q 15:66-70

The **Kamaiya** system was hereditary **bonded labour** in **Nepal** (abolished 2000). Under British rule India supplied **raw materials** and bought **British manufactures**. The *Arthashastra* (Kautilya) deals with statecraft, the king's duties and finance. A commercial LPG cylinder holds **19 kg**; a domestic one **14.2 kg**.

