@end

@up UP link: UP led India in **infrastructure spending** in 2019-23 and has the most **GI tags** of any state (over 75), including **Nizamabad black pottery**, Banarasi saree, Bhadohi carpets and Moradabad brassware. The **V.V. Giri Labour Institute** and **NIESBUD** are in **Noida**, and the **Carpet Technology Institute** is at **Bhadohi**.

@trap
**NEP 2020: Kasturirangan; replaced the 1986 policy.** **Year of Millets 2023.** **Marginal man: Park; missing women: Sen.** **CCI 2003 (Act 2002).** **Goiporia = bank service; Rekhi = indirect taxes; Tarapore = convertibility.** **Ricardo wrote *Principles*; Hirschman *Strategy*; Kaldor *Strategic Factors*.** **Trusteeship = Gandhi.** **Taylor = scientific management.** **UP top in infrastructure spending 2019-23.** **AGMARK 1937, not FCI.** **Ecomark 1991.** **ISO 14001 = environment.** **Nizamabad = black pottery.** **USOF = telecom.**
@end

